<section class="step" id="step-github-app" data-s="2" aria-labelledby="s2h">
    <h1 id="s2h">Create Intakt's GitHub App</h1>
    <p class="lead">The app lets Intakt read issues, push branches and open pull requests in your repository, and nothing else. GitHub asks you to confirm, then sends you back here.</p>
    <button class="btn secondary" type="button" disabled aria-describedby="app-not-wired">Create the app on GitHub</button>
    <p class="muted app-permissions">Permissions it asks for: issues, pull requests and contents on this repository only.</p>
    <p class="not-wired" id="app-not-wired">Creating the app from this page is not built yet, so the button does nothing. Until it is, Intakt reads its app from GITHUB_APP_ID, GITHUB_APP_INSTALLATION_ID and GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY.</p>
    <div class="step-nav"><a class="btn quiet" href="{{ back }}">Back</a><span class="grow"></span><a class="btn primary" href="{{ continue }}">Continue</a></div>
</section>
